WEBVTT

00:01:40.120 --> 00:01:40.910
You're too kind.

00:01:40.910 --> 00:01:42.160
You hillbilly samurai!

00:01:42.160 --> 00:01:43.950
Move onward!

00:01:43.950 --> 00:01:44.950
Just a moment...

00:01:44.950 --> 00:01:46.040
Time for battle!

00:01:46.040 --> 00:01:47.750
Know your place!

00:01:47.750 --> 00:01:48.330
Die!

00:01:48.960 --> 00:01:50.170
You're too kind.

00:01:56.050 --> 00:01:57.430
Damned brat!

00:01:59.090 --> 00:02:01.350
Your attacks are so weak!

00:02:03.430 --> 00:02:05.100
Don't get too cocky!

00:02:10.810 --> 00:02:15.190
You're nothing but a
sneaky bastard who's full of shit!

00:02:17.700 --> 00:02:20.990
I thought you two were supposed to be
the Blues and Reds' number three?

00:02:20.990 --> 00:02:23.530
Is that really all you've got?

00:02:23.530 --> 00:02:27.000
Frankly, I hate winning points when it's so easy.

00:02:30.170 --> 00:02:31.420
You son of a...!

00:02:33.750 --> 00:02:36.210
I'll shut that big mouth of yours!

00:02:36.960 --> 00:02:38.590
Don't lump me in with this idiot!

00:02:40.590 --> 00:02:42.300
Think I'll go for the 4,000 points first!

00:02:48.520 --> 00:02:49.940
Is that...

00:02:50.940 --> 00:02:52.020
...what I think it is?

00:03:00.700 --> 00:03:03.530
I recognize that sword...

00:03:03.530 --> 00:03:05.910
It's the same one that appeared a year ago...!

00:03:05.910 --> 00:03:09.040
It's the Silver King...

00:03:21.010 --> 00:03:23.260
Shiro!

00:03:24.050 --> 00:03:26.720
You come invading a person's home...

00:03:26.720 --> 00:03:30.350
And worse, you try to hurt his family...

00:03:30.350 --> 00:03:32.600
I'd call that the height of arrogance...

00:03:32.600 --> 00:03:34.480
Green King...

00:03:34.480 --> 00:03:36.230
Hisui Nagare!

00:03:41.110 --> 00:03:44.570
<i>Is this a dream... or am I seeing things?</i>

00:03:46.620 --> 00:03:48.620
It is an honor to finally meet you...

00:03:48.620 --> 00:03:52.920
First King Adolf K. Weismann,
the Silver King.

00:03:52.920 --> 00:03:57.630
I am Mishakuji Yukari,
a J-rank of the Green Clan JUNGLE.

00:03:57.630 --> 00:03:59.260
And...

00:04:01.050 --> 00:04:03.970
I apologize for our king
not being here with us today.

00:04:03.970 --> 00:04:06.510
But he will be speaking through our clansman.

00:04:11.100 --> 00:04:14.480
Greetings, Silver King.

00:04:14.480 --> 00:04:18.650
I am the Fifth King Hisui Nagare,
the Green King.

00:04:19.440 --> 00:04:21.070
I've long-awaited for this moment.

00:04:24.990 --> 00:04:28.410
I guess this means you managed to lure me out...

00:04:29.700 --> 00:04:31.290
Didn't you, Green King?

00:04:31.870 --> 00:04:33.290
Affirmative.

00:04:33.830 --> 00:04:39.050
This verifies that you are not
the bystander that you once were.

00:04:40.050 --> 00:04:42.550
It's quite a strategic success.

00:04:44.970 --> 00:04:49.260
And you used my Kuroh as bait?

00:04:49.260 --> 00:04:51.350
You kings can be so cruel...

00:04:51.350 --> 00:04:52.810
Affirmative.

00:04:53.680 --> 00:04:56.350
And in the same vein,
I am issuing a change of orders.

00:04:56.350 --> 00:04:58.650
Please withdraw immediately.

00:04:59.020 --> 00:05:00.610
Huh?!

00:05:00.980 --> 00:05:04.700
You don't want me
to take care of our big catch?

00:05:04.700 --> 00:05:07.110
No. Withdraw immediately.

00:05:15.210 --> 00:05:16.370
Well that's too bad...

00:05:16.370 --> 00:05:18.380
I can't say I'm pleased...

00:05:18.380 --> 00:05:21.000
But my King orders it so.

00:05:21.420 --> 00:05:24.170
Fine, we'll take our leave, Silver King.

00:05:29.260 --> 00:05:30.890
Did you hear that, Sukuna-chan?

00:05:31.470 --> 00:05:33.310
This mission is over.

00:05:34.060 --> 00:05:36.390
No buts about it. Let's go.

00:05:36.390 --> 00:05:41.070
Sheesh... Can't believe I have to
quit such an easy game...

00:05:44.110 --> 00:05:45.440
Kuroh-chan...

00:05:45.440 --> 00:05:49.450
In deference to the Silver King who
selflessly rushed to your rescue,

00:05:49.450 --> 00:05:51.830
I'll let you live for today.

00:05:51.830 --> 00:05:55.040
Next time though, let me enjoy myself more.

00:05:55.790 --> 00:05:59.290
Otherwise, I'll cut you down like a dead branch.

00:06:16.430 --> 00:06:18.020
Can you get up, Kuro?

00:06:37.460 --> 00:06:39.170
Welcome back...

00:06:39.870 --> 00:06:40.960
My...!

00:06:41.630 --> 00:06:44.250
Shiro!

00:06:46.670 --> 00:06:51.590
Shiro! Shiro! Shiro! Shiro!

00:06:51.590 --> 00:06:53.550
I missed you so much!

00:06:53.550 --> 00:06:54.970
What have you been doing?

00:06:54.970 --> 00:06:57.060
Why didn't you come back?

00:06:57.060 --> 00:06:58.770
Why?
How dare you...!

00:06:58.770 --> 00:06:59.640
Why? Why?

00:06:59.640 --> 00:07:00.650
I was just about to ask him that...!

00:07:00.650 --> 00:07:02.520
Please tell me why!

00:07:02.810 --> 00:07:05.900
We looked everywhere for you, Shiro!

00:07:05.900 --> 00:07:08.530
We searched and searched!

00:07:08.530 --> 00:07:10.110
We went around places...

00:07:10.110 --> 00:07:12.200
And then those staticky Greens came after us...

00:07:12.200 --> 00:07:14.990
And glitter guy went "swoosh!"
and beat up Kurosuke...

00:07:14.990 --> 00:07:17.660
And Anna went all "boom!" in fire...

00:07:21.540 --> 00:07:25.290
And even after that,
we still kept on looking for you.

00:07:26.250 --> 00:07:28.420
And then... And then...

00:07:35.430 --> 00:07:36.680
I'm home.

00:07:38.640 --> 00:07:39.680
Welcome back.

00:07:42.400 --> 00:07:44.060
Anyway, you heard her.

00:07:44.060 --> 00:07:45.690
Come on, just admit it.

00:07:46.320 --> 00:07:48.940
This is supposed to be our tearjerker moment.

00:07:48.940 --> 00:07:51.650
Where you come running up
to me like Neko here...

00:07:51.650 --> 00:07:54.570
and say, "I missed you too, Shiro!"

00:07:57.160 --> 00:07:59.080
In your dreams!

00:08:03.870 --> 00:08:04.580
Sorry.

00:08:05.330 --> 00:08:07.590
No, I'm glad you're alive.

00:08:08.800 --> 00:08:10.130
The same goes for you.

00:08:11.340 --> 00:08:13.510
How up to date are you?

00:08:13.510 --> 00:08:15.260
I know pretty much what's happening.

00:08:15.260 --> 00:08:19.060
Otherwise, how could I make
that perfectly timed entrance?

00:08:19.060 --> 00:08:22.730
You mean that was all intentional?!

00:08:23.060 --> 00:08:25.190
Maybe. Who knows?

00:08:25.940 --> 00:08:28.190
You haven't changed at all, you clown...

00:08:28.650 --> 00:08:29.980
I was working behind the scenes...

00:08:29.980 --> 00:08:34.280
hoping I could handle this without
getting everyone mixed up in it.

00:08:34.950 --> 00:08:38.910
But the Green Clan moved
more quickly than I expected.

00:08:38.910 --> 00:08:42.160
They outlasted me and
drew me out into the open.

00:08:42.160 --> 00:08:46.210
In the end, I only achieved in
causing everyone more trouble.

00:08:47.000 --> 00:08:49.550
Damned right, you jerk.

00:08:52.470 --> 00:08:56.090
If you had just shown up and
shared the joy and pain with us,

00:08:56.090 --> 00:08:57.470
we wouldn't be having this discussion!

00:08:58.350 --> 00:09:04.270
Adolf K. Weismann, no, Isana Yashiro...

00:09:04.270 --> 00:09:05.730
We're your clansmen. Don't forget that.

00:09:08.310 --> 00:09:11.730
Yeah, Shiro! You're our King!

00:09:14.820 --> 00:09:16.490
Neko...

00:09:16.490 --> 00:09:18.240
Kuro...

00:09:18.240 --> 00:09:18.570
You're too kind.

00:09:18.570 --> 00:09:20.410
Do your best.

00:09:20.410 --> 00:09:21.790
Just a moment...

00:09:21.790 --> 00:09:23.000
Easy there.

00:09:23.620 --> 00:09:24.250
Alas!

00:09:27.460 --> 00:09:29.000
Oh, sorry!

00:09:31.050 --> 00:09:33.010
So? What now?

00:09:35.340 --> 00:09:37.930
I know how cunning you are.

00:09:37.930 --> 00:09:40.260
You didn't just let them lure you out, right?

00:09:41.100 --> 00:09:45.350
I'd like to think that you have
prepared a counter plan or two.

00:09:45.350 --> 00:09:49.020
I may have something up my sleeve...

00:09:49.810 --> 00:09:53.070
Until recently the Green Clan were only potential threats.

00:09:53.070 --> 00:09:55.360
But now that they've officially made their move,

00:09:55.360 --> 00:09:57.950
it will take more than just
the three of us to deal with them.

00:09:58.990 --> 00:10:00.030
Which is why...

00:10:05.120 --> 00:10:07.790
Can I ask you boys to deliver
a message to your kings?

00:10:08.960 --> 00:10:09.790
Huh?

00:10:12.290 --> 00:10:14.380
Well done! Well done!

00:10:14.380 --> 00:10:15.800
Well done!

00:10:16.760 --> 00:10:20.050
Third King Kushina Anna, the Red King...

00:10:21.260 --> 00:10:24.930
Fourth King Munakata Reisi, the Blue King...

00:10:25.520 --> 00:10:26.930
And myself...

00:10:26.930 --> 00:10:33.320
First King Adolf K. Weismann,
the Silver King, a.k.a. Isana Yashiro...

00:10:34.230 --> 00:10:38.900
Three prominent figures gathering
at a table for a discussion...

00:10:40.570 --> 00:10:42.580
I suppose we can call this a round table conference?

00:10:42.580 --> 00:10:45.450
You mean this coffee table?

00:10:45.450 --> 00:10:48.080
It's not even round! It's a rectangle!

00:10:59.880 --> 00:11:01.430
We're already packed like sardines in here.

00:11:02.050 --> 00:11:04.930
So stop your whining.
You're going to suffocate us all.

00:11:05.260 --> 00:11:06.430
Screw you!

00:11:06.720 --> 00:11:08.430
You should talk!

00:11:08.430 --> 00:11:10.440
You and your horde of Blues!

00:11:22.700 --> 00:11:25.160
The last thing we need is for you punks

00:11:25.160 --> 00:11:27.700
to cause more trouble like you did a year ago...

00:11:28.080 --> 00:11:30.210
That's why we're here to keep things in order.

00:11:30.210 --> 00:11:31.540
What?!

00:11:32.210 --> 00:11:35.880
Yata-chan, this is a gathering of VIPs.

00:11:35.880 --> 00:11:37.710
Let's tone it down a bit.

00:11:38.260 --> 00:11:40.720
You too, Fushimi... Stop provoking him.

00:11:41.260 --> 00:11:43.220
Sorry.

00:11:53.480 --> 00:11:54.730
Um...

00:11:55.400 --> 00:11:57.730
Excuse me...

00:11:58.360 --> 00:12:00.240
Please have some tea.

00:12:01.780 --> 00:12:03.740
Thank you, Kukuri.

00:12:05.120 --> 00:12:07.080
Y-You're welcome...

00:12:08.620 --> 00:12:10.750
Sorry for making you do all the work.

00:12:10.750 --> 00:12:12.750
Oh, I don't mind at all.

00:12:12.750 --> 00:12:14.500
You're Shiro-kun, right?

00:12:14.500 --> 00:12:19.760
It's obvious that Kuro-kun and Neko don't want to
leave your side now that they've finally found you.

00:12:20.760 --> 00:12:22.880
It's not like that.

00:12:22.880 --> 00:12:25.050
This is a formal meeting of the three sides...

00:12:25.050 --> 00:12:26.760
Kukuri's right!

00:12:26.760 --> 00:12:30.180
I'm never, ever leaving his side again!

00:12:32.850 --> 00:12:34.810
Shall we begin our round table...

00:12:34.810 --> 00:12:38.940
or should I say, coffee table conference,

00:12:38.940 --> 00:12:41.780
Silver King Adolf K. Weismann?

00:12:42.860 --> 00:12:45.320
Oh, pardon me.

00:12:52.750 --> 00:12:58.630
And please, just call me Isana Yashiro,
Blue King Munakata Reisi.

00:12:58.630 --> 00:13:00.800
You too, Red King Kushina Anna.

00:13:01.260 --> 00:13:04.550
Thank you for coming on such short notice.

00:13:06.970 --> 00:13:08.140
It's all right.

00:13:08.140 --> 00:13:12.810
I've wanted to repay
your clansman for all their help.

00:13:14.310 --> 00:13:16.350
Thank you, Anna!

00:13:16.350 --> 00:13:18.810
If we're going by that logic...

00:13:18.810 --> 00:13:24.240
Then I'd say you both owe us for having
to always clean up after your messes.

00:13:31.240 --> 00:13:34.710
Well, putting that aside for now...

00:13:35.250 --> 00:13:37.710
What is the purpose of this meeting?

00:13:40.000 --> 00:13:44.210
I'm sure someone like you has a pretty good idea.

00:13:44.590 --> 00:13:46.630
What to do about the Green Clan...

00:13:46.630 --> 00:13:48.220
That has to be it.

00:13:50.510 --> 00:13:51.970
You're absolutely right.

00:13:51.970 --> 00:13:55.390
It took long enough, but now,

00:13:55.390 --> 00:13:59.230
something has come up that requires us to discuss.

00:14:06.110 --> 00:14:10.740
The Second King,
Kokujoji Daikaku the Gold King...

00:14:11.280 --> 00:14:12.740
has passed away...

00:14:26.760 --> 00:14:27.760
I see...

00:14:28.090 --> 00:14:34.470
The Dresden Slates wield a latent power that
can affect all of Japan... no, the entire world.

00:14:34.470 --> 00:14:39.770
And the strongest king who was the pillar of keeping it under control, is gone?

00:14:40.190 --> 00:14:43.770
Is that why the Green Clan has become so active?

00:14:45.860 --> 00:14:49.860
With the Lieutenant,
I mean the Gold King, gone,

00:14:49.860 --> 00:14:52.070
the Green King has nothing to fear.

00:14:52.660 --> 00:14:56.790
There's no reason to suppress
his ambitions or powers anymore.

00:14:56.790 --> 00:15:01.790
But we heard they were looking for you too.

00:15:01.790 --> 00:15:05.050
Don't they fear you too?

00:15:05.420 --> 00:15:09.550
I don't pose a direct threat to them
like the Gold King did.

00:15:09.550 --> 00:15:12.550
However, I possess knowledge
about the Slates that they're after.

00:15:12.970 --> 00:15:15.010
And my power is eternal,

00:15:15.010 --> 00:15:18.560
which is the opposite of their power to manipulate.

00:15:19.140 --> 00:15:21.400
Are you saying they couldn't anticipate your move

00:15:21.400 --> 00:15:24.060
because you were a wild card?

00:15:24.610 --> 00:15:25.480
Yes.

00:15:26.070 --> 00:15:28.820
The Gold King knew this,

00:15:28.820 --> 00:15:31.570
which is why he kept me hidden as long as he could, but...

00:15:31.570 --> 00:15:33.070
I'm totally lost...

00:15:37.330 --> 00:15:42.040
<i>What a waste... to close my eyes.</i>

00:15:45.670 --> 00:15:47.050
<i>Yes...</i>

00:15:58.140 --> 00:15:59.680
<i>Lieutenant...</i>

00:15:59.680 --> 00:16:03.690
<i>Just as you did, I will move forward
until my very last breath...</i>

00:16:05.150 --> 00:16:06.860
<i>I won't run away this time.</i>

00:16:07.730 --> 00:16:09.280
<i>I will face it head on.</i>

00:16:13.910 --> 00:16:17.280
Now, they've pulled me back here.

00:16:19.660 --> 00:16:22.160
The Green Clan won't hold back anymore.

00:16:22.160 --> 00:16:24.830
And they'll be calculating how the wild card

00:16:24.830 --> 00:16:27.250
will be used as they continue to challenge us.

00:16:28.960 --> 00:16:31.170
So the remaining three kings must work together

00:16:31.170 --> 00:16:33.510
to counter the Green Clan.

00:16:33.510 --> 00:16:36.050
Is that what you're proposing?

00:16:36.550 --> 00:16:37.510
Yes.

00:16:37.510 --> 00:16:39.970
Especially now that the most powerful Gold King

00:16:39.970 --> 00:16:42.180
is no longer with us.

00:16:42.180 --> 00:16:43.310
Is that it?

00:16:43.310 --> 00:16:44.060
What do you say?

00:16:46.810 --> 00:16:48.360
I have no objection.

00:16:48.360 --> 00:16:53.570
The Blue Clan SCEPTER 4's mission is to maintain order.

00:16:53.570 --> 00:16:55.160
But Captain...!

00:16:55.160 --> 00:16:57.070
Are you sure about this?

00:16:57.320 --> 00:17:03.080
Awashima-kun, we've worn ourselves out
trying to counter the Green Clan.

00:17:03.540 --> 00:17:06.460
Having powerful allies will be worth it,

00:17:06.460 --> 00:17:09.500
even if we have to put up
with a little friction among us.

00:17:11.170 --> 00:17:12.260
Reisi...

00:17:13.510 --> 00:17:15.590
I told you before...

00:17:16.130 --> 00:17:19.100
I don't want to say "thank you."

00:17:29.150 --> 00:17:32.230
But I also said it was what Mikoto had wished for,

00:17:32.230 --> 00:17:35.320
and that I will not hate you for it.

00:17:35.320 --> 00:17:40.740
The Red Clan will fight alongside
the Silver Clan and the Blue Clan.

00:17:42.490 --> 00:17:44.960
I pledge this as the Red King.

00:17:46.250 --> 00:17:48.000
<i>Mikoto, watch us...</i>

00:17:50.130 --> 00:17:51.500
I accept your offer.

00:17:52.550 --> 00:17:56.010
An alliance between three clans, eh?

00:17:56.010 --> 00:18:01.010
Under the circumstances,
there's no reason to oppose...

00:18:01.010 --> 00:18:01.930
Hell yeah!

00:18:01.930 --> 00:18:06.520
So we're gonna team up and
beat the crap out of those Greens, right?

00:18:06.520 --> 00:18:07.940
I say, let's do it!

00:18:14.860 --> 00:18:15.990
It's payback time!

00:18:15.990 --> 00:18:16.450
Yeah!

00:18:16.450 --> 00:18:18.740
We're gonna squash those Greens like bugs!

00:18:18.740 --> 00:18:19.740
Yeah!

00:18:19.740 --> 00:18:23.830
No blood! No bone! No ash!

00:18:24.620 --> 00:18:26.620
All Special Police Force personnel,

00:18:26.620 --> 00:18:28.830
return to home base immediately and
update our state of alert procedures.

00:18:29.370 --> 00:18:31.670
Make sure everything is set up and ready

00:18:31.670 --> 00:18:34.340
before the Red Clan's representative arrives.

00:18:34.630 --> 00:18:35.840
Yes, sir!

00:18:35.840 --> 00:18:39.840
Representative...? I guess that'll be me.

00:18:39.840 --> 00:18:41.850
Right, Seri-chan?

00:18:42.470 --> 00:18:44.350
Try not to disappoint me, okay?

00:18:44.810 --> 00:18:48.310
By the way, what should we do
with those documents?

00:18:48.310 --> 00:18:49.600
Oh...

00:18:49.980 --> 00:18:51.150
That...

00:18:55.320 --> 00:18:57.400
So now we're going to act like friends, huh?

00:19:03.580 --> 00:19:04.790
Munakata-san!

00:19:06.950 --> 00:19:08.620
Is there something else I can help you with...

00:19:09.160 --> 00:19:10.580
Isana Yashiro?

00:19:22.590 --> 00:19:27.810
You're in charge of the Slates in place of the Gold King, isn't that so?

00:19:28.680 --> 00:19:30.310
Yes. Is that a problem?

00:19:30.850 --> 00:19:35.520
I think it's only natural since
there's no one else who is suitable.

00:19:36.730 --> 00:19:40.320
How much do you know about the Slates?

00:19:40.320 --> 00:19:43.820
Well, I'm nowhere near you, the First King.

00:19:43.820 --> 00:19:45.330
But I have a pretty good idea of it.

00:19:48.580 --> 00:19:53.330
Do you intend to become
the second Kokujoji Daikaku?

00:19:57.170 --> 00:19:58.420
If you don't mind,

00:19:58.420 --> 00:20:00.220
please allow me to help you
with watching over the Slates...

00:20:00.220 --> 00:20:02.840
You expect me to rely on
someone who ran away once?

00:20:15.110 --> 00:20:16.230
<i>It's over.</i>

00:20:18.070 --> 00:20:19.730
<i>Are you running away...?</i>

00:20:20.690 --> 00:20:23.410
<i>Are you running away... Weismann?!</i>

00:20:29.490 --> 00:20:32.660
If it's dealing with the Green Clan,

00:20:32.660 --> 00:20:36.250
your help is more than welcome.

00:20:37.170 --> 00:20:39.800
Now... please excuse me.

00:20:58.230 --> 00:21:01.610
I guess I had that coming...

00:21:01.610 --> 00:21:02.780
Right, Kuro?

00:21:05.780 --> 00:21:07.280
You knew we were here?

00:21:08.620 --> 00:21:09.780
Shiro!

00:21:12.290 --> 00:21:14.790
Was the boss with glasses being mean to you?

00:21:20.750 --> 00:21:23.800
I'm okay. That was nothing.

00:21:24.300 --> 00:21:25.510
Are you sure?

00:21:25.510 --> 00:21:27.800
Are you really okay?

00:21:28.760 --> 00:21:31.720
I made a promise not to run away this time.

00:21:31.720 --> 00:21:34.430
And to face it head on, but...

00:21:38.230 --> 00:21:39.770
<i>One step at a time</i>

00:21:39.770 --> 00:21:42.820
<i>Skip towards the path you
chose, that is all it takes.</i>

00:21:45.990 --> 00:21:46.990
Creepy!

00:21:46.990 --> 00:21:47.820
What?!

00:21:50.830 --> 00:21:52.620
Go back to your room.

00:21:52.620 --> 00:21:55.580
We're having grilled mackerel
and miso soup for dinner.

00:21:56.790 --> 00:21:59.500
Yes! Yes! Yes!

00:21:59.500 --> 00:21:59.830
Yes! Yes! I love fish!

00:21:59.830 --> 00:22:01.590
All right, I get it already...

00:22:01.590 --> 00:22:03.090
Yes! Yes! I love fish!

00:22:04.130 --> 00:22:07.590
By the way, I understand the Gold Clan handled

00:22:07.590 --> 00:22:10.800
all the repairs to my room and
arranged the lease transfer to you.

00:22:10.800 --> 00:22:14.520
I must say, those guys are very efficient.

00:22:15.600 --> 00:22:17.600
The Gold King created a place for you to return to.

00:22:18.520 --> 00:22:19.900
We should be grateful.

00:22:20.610 --> 00:22:23.070
You're right. Thank you, Lieutenant!

00:22:23.070 --> 00:22:24.650
Thank you, thank you!

00:22:24.650 --> 00:22:27.650
Thank you, Lieutenant!

00:23:58.660 --> 00:24:02.250
The alliance formed between the three clans is strong,

00:24:02.250 --> 00:24:05.380
allowing them to repel the Greens.

00:24:05.380 --> 00:24:10.220
But at the same time, anxiety builds
within each of their hearts.

00:24:10.220 --> 00:24:15.010
And finally, the Green King sends
a message on his wings...

00:24:15.010 --> 00:24:18.220
Join hands, or to go to war.

00:24:18.220 --> 00:24:21.810
Next time on <i>K: Return of Kings,</i>

00:24:21.810 --> 00:24:24.020
#5 "Ken".

00:24:24.020 --> 00:24:27.480
No one can walk straight through the jungle...
